# apps/api — local rules only.
#
# Secrets, the transcript corpus and all Python build/cache patterns live in
# the root .gitignore so there is a single place to audit them. Keep this file
# small.
#
# NOTE: this file used to be the stock GitHub Python template plus a bare
# `articles/` rule. That rule silently excluded apps/api/data/articles/ —
# 1.7 MB of parsed articles the recommender reads at runtime, which both the
# README and the root .gitignore say is tracked. Do not reintroduce it.

# Scraper and parser scratch output
french.txt
spanish50k.txt
youtubers_*

# Local overrides
local_settings.py
